    "video: seek to 14.5 s lands (14.50 s, readyState 4)",
    "content listener served Range requests from a non-zero offset (206): bytes=15728640-, bytes=15892480-",
    "video: after its ticket lapsed, a seek back to 7 s (unbuffered) renewed the ticket through the binding and landed",
    "server-side: the lapsed ticket now answers 410 (absolute expiry, no sliding extension)",
    "no content-listener request carried a cookie, Referer or the shell token",
    "download: the file saved by the browser is byte-identical (sha256) and named synthetic-clip.mp4",
    "download was started by the shell document from a ticket (attachment) on the content origin",
    "open: the shell opened the file in a new tab on the content origin (no opener)",
    "download.request without an owner click is refused by the shell (denied)",
    "index: Files home lists recent files (synthetic-sunset.jpg / synthetic-clip.mp4) from the bounded index",
    "upload: 5 MiB + 12345 B landed in Documents byte-identical (sha256)",
    "upload: progress shown while uploading (uploading|Uploading 0% \u00b7 0 B of 5.0 MB / uploading|Uploading 19% \u00b7 1.0 MB of 5.0 MB / uploading|Uploading 39% \u00b7 2.0 MB of 5.0 MB)",
    "resume: the connection dropped for 3 s (6 chunk request(s) cut) \u2192 \"Reconnecting\u2026 n% kept\", then the upload carried on from the server's offset",
    "upload port: 6 chunks of at most 1 MiB, each answered 200 after its own Service check",
    "chunks resumed at increasing server offsets (no byte sent twice past the acknowledged offset)",
    "the uploaded file shows in the folder listing",
    "cancel: the cancelled file never appears in Documents",
    "cancel: the box reports the real outcome (aborted) \u2192 \"Upload cancelled\"",
    "scoping: app data is browsable in the app scope",
    "scoping: an upload into app data is refused server-side (not_allowed); a ../ folder is refused (bad_request)",
    "typed only: extra arguments refused, a forged resource id is not_found, a path is never a resource id",
    "server-side: the frame's own direct reads of /wizard-files/api (list, content) were refused 403 by the listener (403,403)",
    "another app's opaque frame: files.list, media tickets and the upload port are all refused (not_allowed)",
    "server-side: its direct read of /wizard-files/api was refused 403 (1 request(s))",
    "same-origin app tab: /wizard-files/api/files refused 403 by the listener (browser request, no adapter credential)",
    "listener: the owner's tailnet login is not adapter authority (403); no or a wrong credential \u2192 401",
    "revocation: the first chunk after files.upload was revoked got 403 from the Service; the upload stopped (Files can\u2019t upload right now: permission changed. Reopen Files to try again.) and no file was placed",
    "dark standalone tab: the listener refuses its API (browser request) and the page says to open Files from Wizard"
